Interpretation:
- FAIL   ...FourStaleMatches: with five concurrent analyses adopting one shared
  body result, four of them finishing leaves four stale same-key slots; Lookup's
  four-entry candidate budget is consumed by the stale slots, validation drops
  them all, and the fifth live owner's body taint is lost (snapshot entries: 0).
- PASS   ...FourSharedOwnersKeepLiveOwner: with only four adopters total, the
  live owner fits inside the candidate budget.
- PASS   ...DefaultConcurrencySharedOwnerKeepsTaint: under the DEFAULT admission
  bound (2 concurrent analyses) the shared result keeps its live owner's taint.
- PASS   ...FreshPerRequestBuffersUnaffected: distinct per-request allocations
  (the ordinary io.ReadAll shape) are unaffected.

